            >Log out</button
          ></section
        ></nav
      ><h3 id="lobby-winner"
        >Winner: <span sse-swap="winner"></span></h3></header
    ><main
      ><aside><p>DebugUser (X)</p></aside
      ><aside><p>HardComputer (O)</p></aside
      ><section class="game-board" hx-swap="innerHTML" sse-swap="board"
        ><button
          type="button"
          hx-post="/api/game-move"
